    "detailed_description": "<strong><u>An epic poem in a lengthy 'Open World'</u></strong><br><br>Enjoy endless adventures and journeys through a continent that reaches about 35 \u33a2 square, many dungeons hidden in it, and a myriad of generated instant dungeons.<br><br><br><strong><u>'Accessibility' added to the battle armed with strategy and 'taste of the hand'</u></strong><br><br>Add defense, avoidance, defensiveness, and repulsion to the close-range, long-range combat methods according to your four jobs, making it easy to work with teams to achieve infinite combo attacks.<br><br><br><strong><u>fun to farm and strengthen numerous equipment</u></strong><br><br>Find 300 kinds of equipment and dozens of set items related to four jobs and strengthen them in various ways to set up your own equipment.<br><br><br><strong><u>Sometimes annihilate enemies alone, sometimes together</u></strong><br><br>A battle that's hard to solve alone can work together up to eight people to exchange equipment and strategize to solve the quest for an ongoing story.<br><br><br><strong><u>My character who grew up so hard determines the superiority and inferiority</u></strong><br><br>In addition to the main story in the game, we are preparing for a large RvR battle where we can engage a large number of users in addition to PvP, which is a 4 vs 4 slaughter in a limited Dungeon.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><u>An epic poem in a lengthy 'Open World'</u></strong><br><br>Enjoy endless adventures and journeys through a continent that reaches about 35 \u33a2 square, many dungeons hidden in it, and a myriad of generated instant dungeons.<br><br><br><strong><u>'Accessibility' added to the battle armed with strategy and 'taste of the hand'</u></strong><br><br>Add defense, avoidance, defensiveness, and repulsion to the close-range, long-range combat methods according to your four jobs, making it easy to work with teams to achieve infinite combo attacks.<br><br><br><strong><u>fun to farm and strengthen numerous equipment</u></strong><br><br>Find 300 kinds of equipment and dozens of set items related to four jobs and strengthen them in various ways to set up your own equipment.<br><br><br><strong><u>Sometimes annihilate enemies alone, sometimes together</u></strong><br><br>A battle that's hard to solve alone can work together up to eight people to exchange equipment and strategize to solve the quest for an ongoing story.<br><br><br><strong><u>My character who grew up so hard determines the superiority and inferiority</u></strong><br><br>In addition to the main story in the game, we are preparing for a large RvR battle where we can engage a large number of users in addition to PvP, which is a 4 vs 4 slaughter in a limited Dungeon.",
    "short_description": "&quot;Pure Blood&quot; is an Open World MORPG that tells the story of those who had to flee the invaded kingdom to find their throne again, and you can feel the &quot;taste of hand&quot; of Soul-Like through easy manipulation.",
